# Device API keys (#96). Management requires a JWT with role Admin; devices send the key in X-Api-Key to POST /api/telemetry.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-admin-access-token-here
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@keyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiKey = paste-key-from-the-issue-response

### Issue the key (plaintext only in this response; 409 if an active key exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotate: revoke the active key and issue a new one (also renews after a revocation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/api-keys/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List keys (metadata only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke a key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/api-keys/{{keyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Device sends telemetry with the key (no JWT); unknown or revoked key -> 401, key of another installation -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "installationId": "{{installationId}}",
  "sentAt": "2026-06-21T10:36:00Z",
  "source": "gateway",
  "readings": [
    { "deviceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "timestamp": "2026-06-21T10:35:00Z", "intervalSec": 300, "status": "MPPT", "acPowerW": 1000, "totalEnergyWh": 1000 }
  ]
}
